content::
Composition is a Part A relationship.
one class contains an object of another class and controls the child object's lifetime.
The contained object depends on the parent object. 
If the parent object is destroyed, its contained object is also destroyed.
Composition promotes code reuse and flexible design.
Aggregation. Represent it by using the empty diamond.
Composition. Represent it by using the filled diamond.
